Package: guesthouse-plasma
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Guesthouse contributors <144541403+s3k000@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: guesthouse-desktop (= @VERSION@), sddm, kde-plasma-desktop, plasma-workspace, konsole, dolphin, kwrite, systemsettings, kscreen, python3
Conflicts: guesthouse-gnome
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Description: Guesthouse: KDE Plasma on the Mac's graphics device
 Plasma (KWin on Wayland) in place of weston, through our Mesa (Zink on
 KosmicKrisp), signed in at boot by SDDM as the account the install made, at
 the scale and with the keyboard layout the Mac app gives. Removing this package
 gives the weston desktop back.
